  "body": "QUALITY 3 BEDROOM FAMILY HOME FOR RELOCATION\r\nThis is a very well buuolt solid family home.\r\nA fantastic opportunity to secure a quality 3 bedroom, 1 bathroom home ready to relocate to your site.\r\nAt approximately 110m², this home offers a practical family-friendly layout. \r\nProperty Features:\r\n\r\n3 bedrooms\r\n1 bathrooms\r\nApprox. 110m²\r\nPractical family layout\r\nReady for relocation\r\n$150,000 incl. GST\r\n\r\nPrice includes:\r\nDelivery within 200km of Auckland and placement onto standard pile foundations.\r\nForde Brothers can also assist with the relocation and consent process, with an experienced in-house architectural team and contacts for geotechnical and surveying requirements.\r\nHave land but unsure whether this house will work on your site?\r\nGet in touch with our team and we can discuss access, site requirements and the relocation process with you.\r\nCall Mike – 027 559 9386\r\nMike@fordebrothers.co.nz\r\nMore relocatable homes available – check out our other listings or visit the Forde Brothers website. https://fordebrothers.co.nz/properties/\r\n\r\nKEYWORDS: transportable home, transportable dwelling, transportable building, transportable house, relocatable house, relocatable dwelling, relocatable building, removable house, removable dwelling, removable home, removable building, villa, house for removal, building for removal, dwelling for removal, home for removal, house haulage, clear my site, houses for removal, homes for removal, buildings for removal, dwellings for removal, renovate, investment, house demolition, demolition, bungalow, character home, character dwelling, character building, development, investment opportunity, developments, preloved home, preloved house, secondhand house, second hand house, portable home, portable house.",
